 entation summaries and late-breaking abstracts are non-archival. The Apri
 l date was an extension of the original March 30 cutoff. Size is an edito
 rial estimate.\nScope: Artificial life and life-like processes in computa
 tional\, robotic and biological systems. Central questions concern emerge
