 nomous systems\, adaptive decision-making\, and human-AI interaction\; br
 ain-machine interfaces and cognitive systems are meaningful extensions. I
 ts interdisciplinary remit is curated without tagging every industrial ap
 plication as a core specialty.\nAdditional topics: Reinforcement Learning
 \, System Identification & Data-driven Dynamics\, BCI & Neurotechnology\,
  Cognitive Science & Computational Cognition\nScope sources (2026): https
 ://www.ieeesmc2026.org/call-for-papers\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://www.ieeesmc.org/conferences/calendar/
LOCATION:Ho Chi Minh City\, Vietnam
END:VEVENT
